:''For other uses, see [[Akane (disambiguation)]].''
'''Akane Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 605
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Akane Cat
|name2 = Akane Cat (Gi)
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Akane Cat (Gi)''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit's low stats and range doesn't make it have any use outside of early-game, not to mention her stats are only usable at level 30 or above, at which point more powerful cats can be invested in instead of Akane Cat.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

